1
00:00:00,296 --> 00:00:02,126
(Penny:)You're a pig, Howard.

2
00:00:02,757 --> 00:00:05,597
(Howard:)How is doable
anything but a compliment?

3
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:08,510
- Why don't we work on the robot?
- Please, Leonard, not now.

4
00:00:08,679 --> 00:00:13,019
(Howard:)Once again, Penny and I
have begun our little tango.

5
00:00:13,184 --> 00:00:14,604
Our... Our tango?

6
00:00:14,769 --> 00:00:17,769
(Howard:)The carnal repartee, the erotic to and fro.

7
00:00:17,939 --> 00:00:21,189
(Howard:)But as delicious
as the appetizer might be...

8
00:00:21,359 --> 00:00:27,529
(Howard:)...at some point we will have to succumb
and eat the entrée while it's still...

9
00:00:27,782 --> 00:00:29,782
[MIMICS SIZZLING]

10
00:00:33,079 --> 00:00:34,909
(Howard:)...hot.

11
00:00:37,541 --> 00:00:40,671
(Leonard:)I'm begging you, stop talking.

12
00:00:41,170 --> 00:00:43,210
(Penny:)Look, normally, I can just ignore you.

13
00:00:43,381 --> 00:00:46,011
(Penny:)I mean, I get it. You're a little peculiar.
Like Sheldon.

14
00:00:46,175 --> 00:00:50,675
(Sheldon:)Yeah, excuse me, Penny, but in this room,
you're the one who's peculiar.

15
00:00:52,348 --> 00:00:53,558
(Penny:)Yeah, you might be right.

16
00:00:54,767 --> 00:00:58,517
But back to you. You think you're some
sort of smooth-talking ladies' man...

